   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "MenuLabel",
   "szText": "\"What is your new plan to stop Belial?\"",
   "hLabel": 4215274549
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line1.20FFCC",
   "szText": "His presence here is too deeply rooted to banish him. I know that now.",
   "hLabel": 2435157307
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line7.20FFCC",
   "szText": "But when we were connected, his vulnerability was laid bare to me.",
   "hLabel": 447777409
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line3.20FFCC",
   "szText": "He knows we can still stop him from pulling all of Sanctuary into his Realm of Lies.",
   "hLabel": 1772697341
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line5.20FFCC",
   "szText": "This is what must be done.",
   "hLabel": 1110237375
  }
 ],
